 ${shlibs:Depends},
 adwaita-icon-theme,
 lightdm,
 librsvg2-common
Description: corporate Fluent-style GTK greeter for LightDM
 A lightweight GTK 3 LightDM greeter with a Fluent-inspired layout, external
 CSS customization, last-successful-user caching and manual Active Directory
 identity entry. The default selector exposes only the remembered identity and
 Other user to avoid enumerating large corporate account directories.
